{"id":"36e88e4e5fc283eb","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/364_组合逻辑_CL.md","title":"364 组合逻辑 CL","display":"364_组合逻辑_CL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"364-组合逻辑-CL\">364 组合逻辑 CL</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。固定可数无限变量集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{CL}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}_{CL}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>未类型组合子集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Comb}_{CL}=\\{S,K,I,B,C,W\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Comb}_{CL}=\\{S,K,I,B,C,W\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>CL 项没有绑定变量、类型标注或上下文。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项闭包\">2. 项闭包</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{CL}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{CL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{Comb}_{CL}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{Comb}_{CL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comb}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\">\\(\\operatorname{comb}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\">\\(M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>显示约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MN=\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\">\\(MN=\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\)</span>，并且应用左结合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与等同\">3. 自由变量、替换与等同</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{CL})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{CL})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{comb}(c))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{comb}(c))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(M)\\cup \\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(M)\\cup \\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{CL})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{CL})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{var}(x))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{comb}(c))\n=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{var}(x))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{comb}(c))\n=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(N)\n=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(N)\n=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{CL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{CL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{CL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{CL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\)</span> 由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comb}(c)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{comb}(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{comb}(c)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{comb}(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M_0,M_1)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(M_0[x:=N],M_1[x:=N])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(M_0,M_1)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(M_0[x:=N],M_1[x:=N])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。因为无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha\\)</span> 是文字等同关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-根规约\">4. 根规约</h1>\n<p>根规约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{CL}\">\\(\\to^0_{CL}\\)</span> 是下列六个局部关系的并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"KXY\\to^0_{CL}X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[KXY\\to^0_{CL}X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"SXYZ\\to^0_{CL}XZ(YZ),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[SXYZ\\to^0_{CL}XZ(YZ),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"IX\\to^0_{CL}X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[IX\\to^0_{CL}X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BXYZ\\to^0_{CL}X(YZ),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BXYZ\\to^0_{CL}X(YZ),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"CXYZ\\to^0_{CL}XZY,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[CXYZ\\to^0_{CL}XZY,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"WXY\\to^0_{CL}XYY,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[WXY\\to^0_{CL}XYY,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\">\\(X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\)</span>。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 分别表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comb}\">\\(\\operatorname{comb}\\)</span> 作用于对应组合子名。形式化地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,K}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(K),X),Y),X):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,K}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(K),X),Y),X):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,S}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(S),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,S}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(S),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,I}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(I),X),X):X\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,I}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(I),X),X):X\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,B}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(B),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(X,\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,B}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(B),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(X,\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,C}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(C),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),Y)):X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,C}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(C),X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),Y)):X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,W}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(W),X),Y),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Y),Y)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,W}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{comb}(W),X),Y),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Y),Y)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{CL}\n=\n\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,K}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,S}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,B}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,C}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,W}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to^0_{CL}\n=\n\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,K}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,S}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,B}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,C}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,W}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-上下文闭包与转换\">5. 上下文闭包与转换</h1>\n<p>定义 CL 一孔上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\">\\(\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\\)</span> 为满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{hole}_{CL}\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\">\\(\\operatorname{hole}_{CL}\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appL}_{CL}(C,P)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\">\\(\\operatorname{appL}_{CL}(C,P)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appR}_{CL}(P,C)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\">\\(\\operatorname{appR}_{CL}(P,C)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填孔函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(\\operatorname{hole}_{CL},M)=M,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(\\operatorname{hole}_{CL},M)=M,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(\\operatorname{appL}_{CL}(C,P),M)\n=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(C,M),P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(\\operatorname{appL}_{CL}(C,P),M)\n=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(C,M),P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(\\operatorname{appR}_{CL}(P,C),M)\n=\\operatorname{app}(P,\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(C,M)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(\\operatorname{appR}_{CL}(P,C),M)\n=\\operatorname{app}(P,\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(C,M)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一步规约定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_{CL}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(C,M),\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL},\\ M\\to^0_{CL}N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_{CL}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(C,M),\\operatorname{plug}_{CL}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL},\\ M\\to^0_{CL}N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等式证明的单步规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{CL}\n=\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\to_{CL}N\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):N\\to_{CL}M\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{CL}\n=\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\to_{CL}N\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):N\\to_{CL}M\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>初始项族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{CL}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{CL}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{comb}(c):c\\in\\mathsf{Comb}_{CL}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{CL}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{CL}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{comb}(c):c\\in\\mathsf{Comb}_{CL}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>转换证明对象集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{CL}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\ M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\ ((\\langle M_i\\rangle,M_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{CL})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{CL}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\ M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\ ((\\langle M_i\\rangle,M_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{CL})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{CL}=(\\operatorname{comb}(S),\\operatorname{comb}(K),\\operatorname{comb}(I),\\operatorname{comb}(B),\\operatorname{comb}(C),\\operatorname{comb}(W),\\to^0_{CL}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{CL}=(\\operatorname{comb}(S),\\operatorname{comb}(K),\\operatorname{comb}(I),\\operatorname{comb}(B),\\operatorname{comb}(C),\\operatorname{comb}(W),\\to^0_{CL}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-可导关系\">6. 可导关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\Rightarrow^*_{CL}N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\Rightarrow^*_{CL}N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}^{n}\">\\((M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}^{n}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_0=M,\\qquad M_{n-1}=N,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_0=M,\\qquad M_{n-1}=N,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_i\\to_{CL}M_{i+1}\">\\(M_i\\to_{CL}M_{i+1}\\)</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+1&lt;n\">\\(i+1&lt;n\\)</span> 成立。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M=_{CL}N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M=_{CL}N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{CL}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{CL}\\)</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>规约与证明关系均作为类型化关系给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{CL}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL},\n\\quad\n\\to_{CL}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Der}_{CL}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to^0_{CL}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL},\n\\quad\n\\to_{CL}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Der}_{CL}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{CL}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{CL}\\)</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 步只允许根规约实例、左应用闭包、右应用闭包、反向一步规约或文字等同，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=_{CL}N\">\\(M=_{CL}N\\)</span> 由有限证明对象存在定义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-转换端点与有限证书\">7. 转换端点与有限证书</h1>\n<p>组合逻辑没有绑定构造子，故把文中使用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价名称固定为文字相等：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{CL}\n=\n\\{(M,M):M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_\\alpha^{CL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{CL}\n=\n\\{(M,M):M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_\\alpha^{CL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义端点函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{src}_{CL}(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})=M_0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tgt}_{CL}(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})=M_{n-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{src}_{CL}(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})=M_0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tgt}_{CL}(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})=M_{n-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M=_{CL}N\n\\iff\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{CL}\\ \n(\\operatorname{src}_{CL}(\\pi)=M\\land\\operatorname{tgt}_{CL}(\\pi)=N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M=_{CL}N\n\\iff\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{CL}\\ \n(\\operatorname{src}_{CL}(\\pi)=M\\land\\operatorname{tgt}_{CL}(\\pi)=N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>右端量化对象按定义必为非空有限序列，不借助未定义的无限闭包。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-最终系统\">8. 最终系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CL}=(\\mathsf{Var}_{CL},\\mathsf{Comb}_{CL},\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL},\\operatorname{FV}_{CL},\\operatorname{BV}_{CL},\\operatorname{Sub}_{CL},\\equiv_\\alpha^{CL},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{CL},\\mathsf{Delta}_{CL},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL},\\operatorname{plug}_{CL},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,K},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,S},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,I},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,B},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,C},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,W},\\to^0_{CL},\\to_{CL},\\mathsf{Rule}_{CL},\\Rightarrow^*_{CL},\\mathsf{Der}_{CL},\\operatorname{src}_{CL},\\operatorname{tgt}_{CL},=_{CL}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CL}=(\\mathsf{Var}_{CL},\\mathsf{Comb}_{CL},\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL},\\operatorname{FV}_{CL},\\operatorname{BV}_{CL},\\operatorname{Sub}_{CL},\\equiv_\\alpha^{CL},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{CL},\\mathsf{Delta}_{CL},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{CL},\\operatorname{plug}_{CL},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,K},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,S},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,I},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,B},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,C},\\mathsf{Red}_{CL,W},\\to^0_{CL},\\to_{CL},\\mathsf{Rule}_{CL},\\Rightarrow^*_{CL},\\mathsf{Der}_{CL},\\operatorname{src}_{CL},\\operatorname{tgt}_{CL},=_{CL}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"8.1-完成核对\">8.1 完成核对</h2>\n<p>本文把 CL 写成含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,K,I,B,C,W\">\\(S,K,I,B,C,W\\)</span> 的未类型项重写系统，并逐一列出六个根规约族。系统不含类型判断、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 抽象或解释结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"364-组合逻辑-CL","text":"364 组合逻辑 CL","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项闭包","text":"2. 项闭包","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与等同","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与等同","level":1},{"id":"4.-根规约","text":"4. 根规约","level":1},{"id":"5.-上下文闭包与转换","text":"5. 上下文闭包与转换","level":1},{"id":"6.-可导关系","text":"6. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-转换端点与有限证书","text":"7. 转换端点与有限证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-最终系统","text":"8. 最终系统","level":1},{"id":"8.1-完成核对","text":"8.1 完成核对","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_{CL}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Comb}_{CL}=\\{S,K,I,B,C,W\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{CL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathsf{Comb}_{CL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{comb}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}","display":false},{"tex":"M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}","display":false},{"tex":"MN=\\operatorname{app}(M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{CL})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{comb}(c))=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(M)\\cup \\operatorname{FV}_{CL}(N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{CL}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{CL})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{var}(x))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{comb}(c))\n=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{CL}(\\operatorname{a